   ],
   "speech": "This is a giraffe. Turn it upside down and it's a penguin, read the label at the bottom. Nobody painted it, a model made it. On the right are cutouts with real transparency, fire, feathers, fur. Next to each one, white is solid and black is see-through. They all came from a model that only outputs plain RGB."
