   "speech": "Here's the roadmap: five papers, five handles. Where things are, Peekaboo. What you see from each angle, Diffusion Illusions. How see-through, MAGICK. How things move, Go-with-the-Flow. And changing the motion of a video that already exists, MotionV2V. The method climbs too: the first two train nothing, then we make the training data, then we change the noise and fine-tune, then we train a control branch."
