   ],
   "speech": "So: Peekaboo got masks with no training. Illusions got one print, many pictures. MAGICK got real transparency from an RGB model. Go-with-the-Flow got motion from warped noise. MotionV2V edits motion in real videos. Three follow-ups I co-authored already build on these. And that RickRoll? Warped noise like that is all a video model needs to follow Rick's motion. Thank you, happy to take questions."
